displayName: "Quick Schematics"
name: "quick-schema"
author: "Seven"
main: "quickschema.QuickSchemaMod"
description: """
Quick Access Favorites Bar for Mindustry Schematics!

Works seamlessly on both PC and Mobile.

Quick Guide:
• Add Schematics: Tap empty [+] slot or click "Quick Access" inside Mindustry's Schematics dialog.
• Quick Select: Tap any schematic slot on the HUD bar to equip it instantly for placement.
• Dynamic Growth: The bar extends dynamically from 1 to 36 slots as you add schematics.
• Reposition Bar: Tap the [🔄] position button to switch between Top-Right (Under Minimap), Left-Center, and Bottom-Left.
• Remove / Options: Right-click or long-press any slot to manage or remove it.
• Clear All: Open "Quick Access" in Schematics dialog to empty all slots at once.
"""
version: "1.0"
minGameVersion: 158
java: true
